      "role": "user",
      "content": "i used to feel like everything had a purpose, you know? like there was someone watching out for me or at least a reason why i was even here. but lately it just feels like... nothing. like i'm just floating in this massive, freezing dark space and there's nothing on the other side. it's terrifying. it feels like i'm just wasting time existing for no reason at all.",
